{"at": "2026-10-30T17:51:16.180596+00:00", "event_id": "01M66YZXPMP8YX6281CMSNJP6W", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "operator", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M66YZXPKH6YXWFZYHB7H5MKT", "input_key": "seed_write_capability", "mission_id": "01M66YYX43K243WESFE0QRZ1MJ", "mission_slug": "migration-actor-cli-spoofing-01M66YYX", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["Refuse caller-supplied seed-shaped identities at every boundary that records them verbatim (issue Option 1)", "Escape or re-parse the value into a live actor", "Add an explicit seed field to the events contract (issue Option 2)"], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "How should a caller-supplied 'migration:' identity be distinguished from a genuine reconstruction seed (#6754)?", "recorded_at": "2026-10-30T17:51:16.180596Z", "run_id": "01M66YZXPKH6YXWFZYHB7H5MKT", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-30T17:51:16.179745Z", "step_id": "specify.boundary.seed-write-capability"}}
{"at": "2026-10-30T17:51:19.417745+00:00", "event_id": "01M66Z00VS1JRVHDZFWF47TJ15", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M66YZXPKH6YXWFZYHB7H5MKT", "final_answer": "Option 1: refuse a caller-supplied identity that starts with 'migration:' at every boundary that records it verbatim (agent status emit --actor, the four orchestrator-api lifecycle verbs, the hidden implement --actor), and keep in-process migration writers as the only producers. Option 2 (an explicit event field) is deferred to spec-kitty-events#92: it needs an events release and the Java write core, both frozen by ADR 2026-10-29-1. The value is never silently rewritten, so no log records an identity the caller did not write. Sourced from the operator dispatch brief for this mission and issue #6754's own Option 1.", "mission_id": "01M66YYX43K243WESFE0QRZ1MJ", "mission_slug": "migration-actor-cli-spoofing-01M66YYX", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-30T17:51:19.417745Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M66YZXPKH6YXWFZYHB7H5MKT", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-30T17:51:19.416881Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
